            <div id="section_body">

                <section id="Gettingstarted">
                    <h1 class="title">Getting Started</h1>
                    <div class="accordion_data">
                        <div class="accordion">
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <div class="accordion-header" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="section-id">
                                    <div class="accordion-title">How to Sign Up?</div>
                                    <div class="accordion-icon">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Getting started with Minopcloud is quick and hassle-free. Just follow the simple steps below to create your free account and start managing employee attendance with ease.</p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Visit <a href="https://app.minopcloud.com/">app.minopcloud.com</a>.</li>
                                        <li>
                                            Click the “Sign Up” button at the top-right corner of the page.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Fill in the registration form:
                                            <ul>
                                                <li>
                                                    <b>Company Name</b> (e.g., ABC Limited)
                                                </li>
                                                <li>
                                                    <b>Email Address</b> (e.g., xyz@abc.com)
                                                </li>
                                                <li>
                                                    <b>Domain Name</b> (used as your subdomain at yourcompany.minopcloud.com)
                                                </li>
                                                <li>
                                                    <b>Password</b> (Create a secure one)
                                                </li>
                                                <li>
                                                    (Optional)<b>Partner Code</b> if applicable
                                                </li>
                                            </ul>
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Agree to the Terms of Service.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Click the “Register” button.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>Verify your email using the OTP sent to your inbox</li>
                                        <li>
                                            You’ll be redirected to the Minopcloud dashboard upon successful registration.
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>

                                    <div class="slider-container" id="Registrations">
                                        <div class="slide-wrapper">
                                            <div class="slide-block" id="slide-block-0">
                                                <img src="~/assets/images/faq_img/Registration.jpg" alt="Registration" />
                                                <div class="hover-buttons">
                                                    <div class="hover_block">
                                                        <button class="downloadBtn" onclick="downloadImage(this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i></button>
                                                        <button class="fullscreenBtn"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i></button>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>

                                        </div>
                                        <button class="slider-btn prev">❮</button>
                                        <button class="slider-btn next">❯</button>
                                    </div>

                                    <p>This screenshot shows the actual sign-up interface where users can enter their company details to begin.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <div class="accordion-header">
                                    <div class="accordion-title">What are the feature of minop?</div>
                                    <div class="accordion-icon">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Minopcloud is a powerful, cloud-based attendance and workforce management solution designed to simplify HR operations, ensure compliance, and deliver real-time workforce insights. Explore our top features below:</p>
                                    <p><b>Attendance Management</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            Biometric, GPS, and mobile-based clock-in/out
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Real-time attendance syncing
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Missed punch alerts and regularization workflow
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Shift-wise and location-based attendance tracking
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p><b>Leave Management</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            Customizable leave types (CL, PL, SL, etc.)
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Auto leave balance calculations
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Leave request and approval workflow
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Holiday calendar integration
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p><b>Employee Management</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            Add/edit employee records with role mapping
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Bulk import of employee data via Excel
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Employee hierarchy and department structuring
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Status management (active/inactive)
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p><b>Reports & Analytics</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            Daily, weekly, and monthly attendance reports
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Overtime and late entry analysis
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Graphical dashboards for HR insights
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Exportable in Excel, CSV, PDF formats
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p><b>Shift & Schedule Management</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            Fixed, rotational, or flexible shift configuration
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Shift roster view by week/month
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Auto shift allocation
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Real-time visibility of who’s working where
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p><b>Multi-Device & Multi-Location Access</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            Use on desktop, tablet, and mobile devices
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Support for Android/iOS app
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Manage multiple locations from one central dashboard
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Location tagging and device sync status
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p><b>Security & Access Control</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            End-to-end encryption of all data
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Role-based access control (RBAC)
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Session timeout and device logout management
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p><b>Integration Ready</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            API support for HRMS, ERP, and Payroll systems
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Plug-and-play biometric device integration
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Webhooks for custom workflows
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Seamless data export/import tools
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p><b>Mobile App Features</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            GPS-based attendance punch
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Selfie and facial verification
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Leave request & approval
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Real-time notifications and alerts
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <div class="accordion-header">
                                    <div class="accordion-title">What are the system requirements?</div>
                                    <div class="accordion-icon">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>To ensure the best experience with MinopCloud across web and mobile, please check the recommended system specifications below.</p>
                                    <p><b>For Web Access (Desktop/Laptop):</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Browser</b>: Latest version of Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, Safari, or Firefox
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Operating System</b>:
                                            <ul>
                                                <li>
                                                    Windows 10 or higher
                                                </li>
                                                <li>
                                                    macOS 10.15 (Catalina) or newer
                                                </li>
                                            </ul>
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>RAM</b>: Minimum 4GB (8GB recommended for best performance)
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Internet</b>: Stable broadband connection for real-time data sync
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Display Resolution</b>: 1280x720 or above
                                        </li>
                                    </ul><br />
                                    <p><b>For Mobile App Access:</b></p>
                                    <p>Download the MinopCloud mobile app for on-the-go attendance and dashboard access:</p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mantra.minop">Download from Google Play Store (Android)</a>
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <a href="https://apps.apple.com/in/app/minop/id1621692071/">Download from Apple App Store (iOS)</a>
                                        </li>
                                    </ul><br />
                                    <p><b>Android Requirements:</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Version</b>: Android 10.0 or above
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Recommended</b>: 4GB+ RAM, GPS & biometric permissions enabled
                                        </li>
                                    </ul><br />
                                    <p><b>iOS Requirements:</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Device</b>: iPhone 7 or newer

                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>iOS Version</b>: iOS 13.0 or later

                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <div class="accordion-header">
                                    <div class="accordion-title">Navigating the Dashboard</div>
                                    <div class="accordion-icon">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>The Minopcloud dashboard serves as the central hub for managing your organization's attendance and workforce data. It offers real-time insights, quick access to essential features, and customizable views to streamline your HR operations.</p>
                                    <p><b>Dashboard Overview</b></p>
                                    <p>Upon logging in, you'll encounter a user-friendly interface comprising several key components:</p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Team Attendance</b>: Visual representation of daily attendance metrics, including present, absent, and late entries.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Quick Actions</b>:Shortcuts to frequently used functions such as adding new employees, generating reports, and managing shifts.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Notifications Panel</b>: Alerts for pending approvals, system updates, and employee requests.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Attendance Wizard</b>: Monthly overview highlighting holidays, leave applications, and important events.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Live Map Interface</b>:Real-time tracking of field employee's locations, enhancing workforce management.
                                        </li>
                                    </ul><br />

                                    <div class="slider-container" id="dashboards">
                                        <div class="slide-wrapper">
                                            <div class="slide-block" id="slide-block-1">
                                                <img src="~/assets/images/faq_img/Dashboard.jpg" alt="Dashboard" />
                                                <div class="hover-buttons">
                                                    <div class="hover_block">
                                                        <button class="downloadBtn" onclick="downloadImage(this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i></button>
                                                        <button class="fullscreenBtn"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i></button>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>

                                        </div>
                                        <button class="slider-btn prev">❮</button>
                                        <button class="slider-btn next">❯</button>
                                    </div>


                                    <p><b>Key Features</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Shift Management</b>:  Create, assign, and modify employee shifts with ease.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Leave Management</b>:Approve or reject leave requests directly from the dashboard.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Integrated Payroll</b>: Seamless integration with payroll systems to ensure accurate salary calculations based on attendance data.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>Analytics and Reporting</b>:Generate detailed reports to analyze attendance patterns, overtime, and productivity metrics.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <b>User Access Control</b>:Manage user roles and permissions to ensure data security and appropriate access levels.
                                        </li>
                                    </ul><br />
                                    <p><b>Visual Guide</b></p>
                                    <p>For a step-by-step visual walkthrough of the Minopcloud dashboard, you can refer to the official user manual:</p>
                                    <p><a href="https://app.minopcloud.com/Downloads/Minop_User_Manual.pdf"> Minopcloud User Manual (PDF)</a></p>
                                    <p>Additionally, here's a brief video demonstrating the dashboard's functionalities:</p>
                                    <p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3QXN5icobRQ">Minop Module - Dashboard</a></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
                <section id="accountmanagement">
                    <h1 class="title">Account Management</h1>
                    <div class="accordion_data">
                        <div class="accordion">
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <div class="accordion-header">
                                    <div class="accordion-title">How can i reset my password?</div>
                                    <div class="accordion-icon">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            Navigate to the Change Password tab.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Enter your current password, then a new password, and confirm.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Click Save to apply changes.
                                        </li>

                                    </ul>
                                    <b>Pro Tip</b>: Use a strong password with at least 8 characters, a number, and a special symbol.

                                    <div class="slider-container" id="for_pass">
                                        <div class="slide-wrapper">
                                            <div class="slide-block" id="slide-block-2">
                                                <img src="~/assets/images/faq_img/ForgotPassword.jpg" alt="Forgot Password" />
                                                <div class="hover-buttons">
                                                    <div class="hover_block">
                                                        <button class="downloadBtn" onclick="downloadImage(this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i></button>
                                                        <button class="fullscreenBtn"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i></button>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>

                                        </div>
                                        @*<button class="slider-btn prev">❮</button>
                                        <button class="slider-btn next">❯</button>*@
                                    </div>

                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <div class="accordion-header">
                                    <div class="accordion-title">How can i manage my profile settings?</div>
                                    <div class="accordion-icon">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            Go to your profile icon > <b>“Profile Account.”</b>

                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Update your:
                                            <ul>
                                                <li>
                                                    Name, contact number, or address
                                                </li>
                                                <li>
                                                    Profile photo (avatar)
                                                </li>
                                                <li>
                                                    Password under the <b>Change Password</b> tab
                                                </li>
                                            </ul>

                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Click <b>Save</b> to apply changes.
                                        </li>

                                    </ul>
                                    <b>Pro Tip</b>: Always keep your email ID updated for OTPs and notifications.
                                    <div class="slider-container" id="Profile_section">
                                        <div class="slide-wrapper">
                                            <div class="slide-block" id="slide-block-3">
                                                <img src="~/assets/images/faq_img/Profile.jpg" alt="Profile Section" />
                                                <div class="hover-buttons">
                                                    <div class="hover_block">
                                                        <button class="downloadBtn" onclick="downloadImage(this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i></button>
                                                        <button class="fullscreenBtn"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i></button>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>

                                        </div>
                                        <button class="slider-btn prev">❮</button>
                                        <button class="slider-btn next">❯</button>
                                    </div>

                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <div class="accordion-header">
                                    <div class="accordion-title">What is Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)</div>
                                    <div class="accordion-icon">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>For an added layer of protection during login:</p>
                                    <ol>
                                        <li>
                                            Go to Account Settings > Security.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Enable Two-Factor Authentication.

                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Choose your preferred method:
                                            <ul>
                                                <li>
                                                    Email-based OTP
                                                </li>
                                            </ul>

                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Confirm and complete setup.
                                        </li>

                                    </ol>
                                    <p>Once activated, you’ll be asked to enter a second verification code every time you log in — helping prevent unauthorized access even if your password is compromised.</p>
                                    <p><b>Other Security Practices</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            Role-based access controls (RBAC)
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Session timeout for inactive users
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Login activity logs
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Device tracking and manual logout from unknown devices
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p>
                                        <b>Tip</b>:Regularly review your security settings and update your password every 90 days.
                                    </p>

                                </div>
                            </div>


                        </div>
                    </div>
