                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <div class="accordion-header">
                                    <div class="accordion-title">What is Shift and what's the use of shift in attendance software?</div>
                                    <div class="accordion-icon">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>A shift refers to a designated time period assigned to each employee, such as 09:00 AM to 06:00 PM, which represents the official working hours. If an employee arrives before or after this time, it will be recorded as Early In, Early Out, Late In, or Late Out, depending on the situation. This helps in tracking attendance and calculating punctuality based on the predefined shift timings.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <div class="accordion-header">
                                    <div class="accordion-title">Is there any feature that allows rotational shift allocation to bulk users?</div>
