                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Yes, there is a feature called shift allocation, through which the admin can assign shifts to bulk users in a rotational manner.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <div class="accordion-header">
                                    <div class="accordion-title">Can we create multiple shifts?</div>
