                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Yes, as admin you can create multiple shifts and then you can assign any shift any user and it's attendance count like that.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <div class="accordion-header">
                                    <div class="accordion-title">What are the steps for create shift group? </div>
