                                    <p>
                                        <ul>
                                            <li> Log in to your account and click on "Shift", then "Shift Group" and click on &nbsp;<i class="fa-regular fa-plus"></i>&nbsp; button to create shift group. </li>
                                            <li>Go to Shift and click on the &nbsp;<i class="fa-regular fa-plus"></i>&nbsp; button. </li>
                                            <li>Select the shift group. </li>
                                            <li>Click on Company, then go to the Employee section, and click on the Action button. </li>
                                            <li>Go to Allocation Details, assign the shift group, and click Save. </li>
                                        </ul>

                                    </p>
                                    <p><b>Note</b>:For rotational shifts, time overlapping is not allowed.</p>
