                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p><b> Step : 1 </b></p>
                                    <p>
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>Log in to your Minop Admin account.</li>
                                            <li>
                                                Go to Utilities.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Click on Import Employees.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Select the category as Employee.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Choose your Company.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Click on Employee Sample Sheet.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                An Excel sheet will be downloaded.
                                            </li>
                                        </ul>

                                    </p>
                                    <p><b> Step : 2 </b></p>
                                    <p>In this sheet, you need to fill in the necessary data, including:</p>
                                    <p>
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>
                                                Employee Code (Emp Code).
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Employee Name (Emp Name).
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Employee Punch ID (Emp Punch ID).
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Marital Status.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Date of Birth.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Joining Date.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Department.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Shift.
                                            <li>
                                                Email ID.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Gender.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Role Name.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Policy Name.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Branch Name.
                                            </li>

                                        </ul>

                                    </p>
                                    <p><b>Important Guidelines:</b></p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            Branch Name, Policy Name, Role Name, and Shift Name must match exactly as they appear in Minop.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Employee Punch ID, Employee Code, and Email ID must be unique.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Employee Punch ID must be numeric.

                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p><b> Step : 3 </b></p>
                                    <p>Once you have filled in the required data, you need to import the file by following these steps:</p>
                                    <p>
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>
                                                Go to Minop > Utilities > Import Employees.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Select the category as Employees.

                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Choose the Company.

                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Click on Select File and upload the completed Excel sheet.

                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                After selecting the file, click on Import.

                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                Wait for the process to complete.

                                            </li>
                                        </ul>

                                    </p>
                                    <p>If there are any errors in the file, the system will display the error along with the reason behind it.</p>
