                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                   <p>As an employee, you get access to the following features in a summarized manner:</p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Your punching information is visible on the dashboard.</li>
                                        <li>You can apply for leave and request attendance corrections directly from the dashboard.</li>
                                        <li>You can view your total leaves, consumed leaves, and remaining leave balance.</li>
                                        <li>You can access company policies from the dashboard.</li>
                                        <li>You can view upcoming holidays and much more, all from the same place.</li>
