                <section id="developercom">
                    <h1 class="title">Developer Exclusive</h1>
                    <div class="accordion_data">
                        <div class="accordion">
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <div class="accordion-header">
                                    <div class="accordion-title"> What is Minopcloud Developer Account?</div>
                                    <div class="accordion-icon">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Minopcloud empowers developers and system integrators with a robust API ecosystem for seamless integration of time attendance, workforce management, and HR workflows.</p>
                                    <p><b>By creating a Developer Account, you gain access to:</b></p>
                                    <p><b>API Key Management</b></p>
                                    <p>Securely generate and manage your API keys directly from the developer dashboard. All APIs are protected with OAuth 2.0 for secure, token-based access.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <div class="accordion-header">
                                    <div class="accordion-title">Is there an API available for developers?</div>
                                    <div class="accordion-icon">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                   <p>Yes, Minopcloud offers a robust API for developers to:</p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>
                                            Integrate attendance data into third-party apps
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Automate HRMS synchronization
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            Access user logs and biometric device data
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                   <p>Contact <b>helpdesk@mantratec.com</b> for API documentation access.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <div class="accordion-header">
                                    <div class="accordion-title">How do I get API keys or credentials?</div>
                                    <div class="accordion-icon">
                                        <i class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p> Once registered, navigate to:</p>
